abstract: "MCP server for Ghostfolio (open-source wealth management): portfolio performance, holdings, dividends and investments, accounts and balances, activities, benchmarks, watchlist, market data, symbol lookup, exchange rates and transaction import/export. Read-only mode and OIDC/OAuth auth."
